# LF in the repository and in every checkout, Windows included: the golden
# screens (tests/golden/*.txt) are compared byte for byte and the shell
# scripts must run under Git Bash and in containers (iteration 16).
* text=auto eol=lf

# The decision log only grows by appended sections, and every branch adds
# one: merge both sides instead of conflicting, with the blank line before
# each heading kept (scripts/merge-decision-log.sh; plain merge=union drops
# it). Register the driver once per clone with `just merge-driver`; without
# it git falls back to a normal merge and conflicts. Check the section
# order by eye after a merge.
kb/decision-log.md merge=decision-log
